<title>USA: National Service names Brock Hattox CFO.</title>
<headline>National Service names Brock Hattox CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Service Industries Inc said on Friday that it had named Brock Hattox as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company previously announced that Robert Hipps had resigned as senior vice president-finance and chief financial officer to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
